{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國女星林智妍與男星李到晛於2022年合作拍攝話題串流劇《黑暗榮耀》，兩人於2023年4月被爆拍拖，其後大方認愛，前日他們被爆已經分手，雙方事務所亦已證實消息。</p><p>而李到晛昨晚現身韓國仁川國際機場，是他承認甩拖後首次公開露面，他與女神韓韶禧出發</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T09:14:58.636359+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T08:53:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T09:08:14.241457+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:08:14.241457+00:00","content_hash":"89a558a18c362659a3d399eae3b666557f2465fabaf9b73cd360abfa1239bb16","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}